    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Sadia Haque",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102089643839732428347/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXkVbhg3gysZx4pYdZ76babUJ7quMYKKEWpugYi16HAvlsFZKsx=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "I’ve had to go there a few times in the last month to get equipped for the winter and I had remarkable service from a young lady named Catherine. She gave me great recommendations and was patient and kind. I also had to return a pair of boots and the return went very smoothly.",
        "time": 1767762625,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Prathap Navaratnam",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102149109732536242967/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKX_oho-1ItylD5WHeP9FhC9E-FusOLRI5wETd11zXgXOg9XQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "Great Experience here! Ella was very helpful and had a very positive attitude which is rare these days. The manager was very nice too!",
        "time": 1769370670,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Eka",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117798267602681196089/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUs5Jp9u34H0bH9hxzl8H6XLm-xK0g71_oiNn3o81DXTjszXKU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Globo is a great shoe store with a wide variety of styles for all ages. Their website is easy to use and makes browsing and choosing simple. Always find what I need, both in-store and online. Reliable and stylish!",
        "time": 1748974361,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Justine Arnoldi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100313320218160823722/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU8IfVyotswMpLRNEKQ-ztRcF38pK61bNDJ9Nm9NvV8xzuLLHCRPg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "I have been to this store many times this year and am always thoroughly impressed with the customer service! So friendly and professional. Even though they are short staffed most days. They always ask if we need help even when they are clearly busy with other clients. They are all very kind, but the young blond lady (don't have her name unfortunately) is always so so sweet! She is very patient and nice to my daughters as well. I feel the store also has a good selection and if they don't have the pair you are looking for in store, they offer to order it for you to the store or they offer free shipping. Amazing!",
        "time": 1633296722,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Noozah Ansari",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105154741293603635240/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLTPUdj3KDYl13D4t1QYBe876CJIWHM9Iczegn0xKnq7-jl1w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Very disappointed. I bought a pair of sketchers from them. They had a sale on that particular bobs. I tried them at the store and at home. Once worn for a few hours they started scratching the back of my foot. I tried to give it time. But they weren't getting better. Post third day I went back to exchange or possibly return. First of the girl at the front, as soon as she saw I was there to return. Very arrogant and took it personally for the return. Clearly no manager around. They refused the return as the shoes were worn even after showing my scratched feet  How are you suppose to know without wearing them for a few hours. No ones going to wear their shoes at home for hours.",
        "time": 1739318989,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
